  "instruction": "Use Chrome Live Caption on the opened video, determine about how long the pita dough should take to double in size, then use https://vclock.com to create a timer for that duration. Leave the timer visible in the browser.",
  "source": "https://foodwishes.blogspot.com/2013/04/pita-bread-whats-in-your-pocket.html",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Turn on Chrome Live Caption.",
    "Watch the YouTube video and use the YouTube captions to determine that the pita dough should take 2h to double in size.",
    "Open https://vclock.com in the browser.",
    "Click the Timer page.",
    "Create and start a 2h timer.",
    "Leave the timer visible in the browser."
  ],
  "config": [
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "parameters": {
        "command": [
          "google-chrome",
          "--remote-debugging-port=1337",
